        {
          "key": "emergency_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Emergency and scene-control boundary",
          "guidance": "An energy audit is an evidence record, not permission to open equipment, change controls, or perform hazardous testing. Use non-invasive observations unless an approved task, qualified person, suitable instrument, and site procedure control the work. Stop when conditions or system effects differ from the approved plan and route the issue for professional review. Do not delay emergency contact to complete this form, and do not re-enter, touch, reset, or move equipment to collect evidence. Scene command and designated qualified personnel control access, stabilization, and release."
        }
      ]
    },
